      "amount": "1/2 cup"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Place macaroni in a large pot and rinse under cold water.",
    "In the same pot, add enough vegetable oil to cover the pasta. Bring to a boil over medium heat.",
    "Add zanzibar orange juice, lemon juice, saffron threads, salt, and fresh lime zest. Mix well and simmer for 15 minutes or until pasta is tender.",
    "Once pasta is cooked, ladle into papillote leaves and garnish with additional zanzibar citrus juice if desired.",
    "Serve immediately."
